OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSpells of sunshine mixed with
OL,6,Fshowers, these most frequent across
OL,7,FShetland and through the morning.
OL,8,FIncreasing dry and bright spells in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Strong north to
OL,10,Fnorthwest winds gradually easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,13,Fevening with clear spells and light
OL,14,Fwinds. Staying dry for Shetland
OL,15,Fovernight but clouding over for Orkney
OL,16,Fwith a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
