OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry start with bright spells
OL,6,Ffor Shetland, then a few showers in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. Mostly cloudy for
OL,8,FOrkney with scattered showers and
OL,9,Ffreshening easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FEasterly winds Wednesday turning
OL,13,Fnortherly and continuing to push a mix
OL,14,Fof scattered showers and brighter
OL,15,Fspells across the Northern Isles
OL,16,Fthrough the outlook period, wintry for
OL,17,Fa time Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
